        "type": "writing",
        "title": "Some people say that what children watch on TV influences their behaviour while others say the amount of time children spend watching TV influences their behaviour. Discuss both views and give your opinion.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NVLsdb5dPousDoxFWmKlRbm4g8b\"><em><strong>Some people say that what children watch on TV influences their </strong><strong>behaviour</strong><strong> while others say the amount of time children spend watching TV influences their behaviour. Discuss both views and give your opinion.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Children Watching TV<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong> <a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cy3bdEYWoowBihxNSEaliek6gCi\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Children Watching TV&nbsp;cho 2 quan điểm:</strong> Một số người cho rằng nội dung trẻ em xem tr&ecirc;n TV ảnh hưởng đến h&agrave;nh vi của ch&uacute;ng <em>(Quan điểm 1),</em> trong khi những người kh&aacute;c cho rằng lượng thời gian trẻ em d&agrave;nh để xem TV ảnh hưởng đến h&agrave;nh vi của ch&uacute;ng <em>(Quan điểm 2).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NQIwd7tBMoy8pKxO1XoloCyugYd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Thảo luận cả hai quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến của bạn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NXZOdm3poofU2fx1mG9lbaJog4b\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Children Watching TV&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToJHdtjwfo8p8Bx4AowlRHlngEc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JfzmdCI27oh4mKxaXRKlieJygvd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QPXyd3Boco1yfOxZk2Olr1y4gqb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FBq4dl1zhozUpExPObLlXVo6gBc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>the content of TV programs <em>(nội dung của c&aacute;c chương tr&igrave;nh TV)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T38pdGii9ohi8Mxf79alZ5ovgWf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>viewing time <em>(thời lượng xem TV)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sukddc77loPsMxxLtyKlkqdYgFb\">Bạn n&ecirc;n thảo luận mỗi quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của m&igrave;nh về việc ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận Partly Agree</strong>, YouPass sẽ <strong>kh&ocirc;ng ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o cả</strong>, v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh tin rằng <strong>cả nội dung của c&aacute;c chương tr&igrave;nh TV v&agrave; thời gian trẻ d&agrave;nh để xem TV đều c&oacute; ảnh hưởng đến h&agrave;nh vi của ch&uacute;ng . </strong>Với c&aacute;ch lập luận n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WrzIdW6UwoSh7JxtzJslIB1Wg0f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> M&igrave;nh sẽ b&agrave;n về l&yacute; do tại sao nội dung của c&aacute;c chương tr&igrave;nh TV ảnh hưởng đến h&agrave;nh vi của trẻ.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NXMld7nhxoLS2txsTOplLBeZgqD\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> M&igrave;nh sẽ b&agrave;n về l&yacute; do tại sao thời gian d&agrave;nh cho việc xem TV cũng c&oacute; ảnh hưởng đến h&agrave;nh vi của trẻ.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>B&agrave;n về l&yacute; do tại sao nội dung của c&aacute;c chương tr&igrave;nh TV ảnh hưởng đến h&agrave;nh vi của trẻ.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RoD7dJ6YFoa0rLxlxj1l11v0gwo\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Nội dung m&agrave; trẻ <em>tiếp x&uacute;c (are exposed to)</em> qua TV chắc chắn c&oacute; t&aacute;c động lớn đến h&agrave;nh vi của ch&uacute;ng.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F3SKduc0coULWUxdmtVljRMcgah\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IUeudiu1aoOUvpxMpqql1iLegNg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1: </strong>C&aacute;c chương tr&igrave;nh <em>chứa đựng nội dung bạo lực (contain violent content)</em> thường khiến trẻ bắt chước những h&agrave;nh vi n&agrave;y trong cuộc sống.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LVEsdFFcJou8E0xrsCalwXiXgne\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example: </strong>V&iacute; dụ, nhiều trẻ em thường <em>t&aacute;i hiện những đ&ograve;n đ&aacute;nh (recreate fighting moves)</em> hay <em>động t&aacute;c chiến đấu (combat actions)</em> m&agrave; ch&uacute;ng xem được từ phim hoạt h&igrave;nh hoặc chương tr&igrave;nh h&agrave;nh động, dẫn đến <em>gia tăng xung đột (increased conflicts)</em> trong trường học.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HbpvdHkduoXXluxz11LlDui2gVh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9NAdNV46oQXJmxylkfl5Ym9gIf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: TV c&oacute; c&aacute;c chương tr&igrave;nh gi&aacute;o dục được thiết kế bởi c&aacute;c chuy&ecirc;n gia ph&aacute;t triển trẻ em c&oacute; thể <em>th&uacute;c đẩy kỹ năng nhận thức (promote cognitive skills)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WsY5dVc1hoHWivxpdV8lhfURgTf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example:</strong> Những chương tr&igrave;nh như Sesame Street đ&atilde; chứng minh hiệu quả trong việc dạy trẻ về chữ c&aacute;i, số đếm v&agrave; c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học x&atilde; hội, gi&uacute;p trẻ n&acirc;ng cao vốn từ vựng v&agrave; khả năng giải quyết vấn đề.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong>B&agrave;n về l&yacute; do tại sao thời gian d&agrave;nh cho việc xem TV cũng c&oacute; ảnh hưởng đến h&agrave;nh vi của trẻ.</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CjagdHbLyoowjwxYEW4l2Quigug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CjagdHbLyoowjwxYEW4l2Quigug\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Mặt kh&aacute;c, thời lượng xem TV cũng g&acirc;y ra những t&aacute;c động đ&aacute;ng kể</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YQAUdp4s5oICHsxTnw5li8yXgVH\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Eh7ndkbB5osTRWxzj5elVc7LgGd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: Khi trẻ d&agrave;nh qu&aacute; nhiều thời gian trước m&agrave;n h&igrave;nh, ch&uacute;ng sẽ c&oacute; &iacute;t thời gian hơn cho c&aacute;c hoạt động thể chất</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LLqFdjIY0obhESxqms0l8SDbgvh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Điều n&agrave;y dẫn đến<em> lối sống tĩnh tại (sedentary lifestyle)</em> v&agrave; l&agrave;m tăng nguy cơ b&eacute;o ph&igrave; ở trẻ em, như c&aacute;c số liệu thống k&ecirc; đ&atilde; chỉ ra <em>mối tương quan (correlation)</em> giữa thời gian xem m&agrave;n h&igrave;nh v&agrave; c&aacute;c vấn đề về c&acirc;n nặng.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZu4dtpk1oyRVwxmfj8l82Qngpe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LbTpdI8oboC0b4xVRwRlvh4egac\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: việc d&agrave;nh qu&aacute; nhiều giờ xem TV sẽ hạn chế sự tương t&aacute;c x&atilde; hội, khiến trẻ gặp kh&oacute; khăn trong <em>việc đọc c&aacute;c dấu hiệu x&atilde; hội (reading social cues)</em> v&agrave; duy tr&igrave; cuộc tr&ograve; chuyện.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TXWvdgEO3oHSZXx70dyl8Ofrgbp\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example: </strong>Những trẻ d&agrave;nh nhiều thời gian xem TV thường &iacute;t ph&aacute;t triển kỹ năng l&agrave;m việc nh&oacute;m v&agrave; giao tiếp hiệu quả.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QOh0dpvFwodYoYxAfXPlC5RmgbG\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZfnDdniF2oGNDwx08WxlxCDegid\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RyYSd2zx6o7MwHxBNV7lQiclg2e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">content and viewing time <em>(nội dung v&agrave; thời lượng xem TV)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 873,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RJjHdKWndowMFTxUE4glySQpgGd\">Opinions are divided on whether the content of TV programs or the viewing duration has a greater impact on children's behavior. From my perspective, both factors play a role in shaping children's behaviour.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14854,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 874,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H2FAdX4KooYiYyxh4tYlvG7ugKg\"><strong>On the one hand, the content that children are exposed to through TV certainly has a significant impact on their behaviour</strong>. <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">Programs containing violent content often lead children to imitate these behaviours in real life. For example, many children frequently recreate fighting moves or combat actions they see in cartoons or action shows, resulting in increased conflicts at school</span>. <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">In contrast, educational programs designed by child development experts can promote cognitive skills. Shows like Sesame Street have proven effective in teaching children about letters, numbers, and social lessons, helping them enhance their vocabulary and problem-solving abilities.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14854,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 875,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VTbRdrqXEoJTnIx9nsolKRbIgGf\"><strong>On the other hand, viewing time also causes considerable effects.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">When children spend too much time in front of screens, they have less time for physical activities. This leads to a sedentary lifestyle and raises the risk of childhood obesity, as statistics have shown a correlation between screen time and weight issues.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Additionally, spending excessive hours watching TV limits social interaction, making children struggle with reading social cues and maintaining conversations. Children who spend a lot of time watching TV often develop fewer teamwork skills and communicate less effectively.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14854,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 876,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-THb8dCWhUoc7EoxrNKclbicdg8f\">In conclusion, both content and viewing time deserve attention when discussing TV's influence on children's behaviour. Therefore, parents should monitor both factors to ensure that television becomes a supportive tool rather than a hindrance to their children's development.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14854,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
